menu "Gateway: RS485 port"

    config GW_RS485_HW_HALF_DUPLEX
        bool "Hardware RS485 half-duplex mode (UART_MODE_RS485_HALF_DUPLEX)"
        default y
        help
            The UART driver asserts RTS (the transceiver's DE, see gw_bsp) while
            transmitting and releases it on TX_DONE. Disable only for emulators that do
            not model the RS485 UART mode.

endmenu
